BT /F2 20 Tf 50.00 785.89 Td (Assistant Chat Screen and RAG Technical Overview) Tj ET
BT /F2 13.5 Tf 50.00 733.89 Td (Purpose of This Report) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 704.89 Td (This report explains the end-to-end technical process of the ElderMeds assistant chat) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 688.39 Td (screen, why an LLM is used, how Retrieval-Augmented Generation \(RAG\) works in this project,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 671.89 Td (and the main technical terms used in the implementation.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 648.39 Td (The assistant is not just a visual chat box. It is a full workflow that connects the React) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 631.89 Td (Native mobile interface, authenticated Node/Express backend, PostgreSQL health records,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 615.39 Td (Python FastAPI ML service, and a local LLM through Ollama/Llama 3 style endpoints.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13.5 Tf 50.00 582.89 Td (Why an LLM Is Used) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 553.89 Td (The assistant uses a Large Language Model \(LLM\) because users can ask questions in natural) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 537.39 Td (language instead of using fixed forms or buttons.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 513.89 Td (Example user messages:) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 485.39 Td (Did I miss any medicine this week?) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 473.89 Td (Which medicines are running low?) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 462.39 Td (I feel lonely today.) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 450.89 Td (How can I reduce this risk?) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 439.39 Td (Add 20 tablets to Metformin stock.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 415.89 Td (A traditional rule-based chatbot would require many manually written patterns for every) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 399.39 Td (possible sentence. An LLM can understand flexible wording, identify the user's intent,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 382.89 Td (generate database queries for record-based questions, and produce readable answers.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 359.39 Td (This is especially useful for elderly users and caregivers because they do not need to know) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 342.89 Td (exact app terminology. They can ask questions in a natural way, and the system can still) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 326.39 Td (route the request to the correct workflow.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13.5 Tf 50.00 293.89 Td (Technical Justification for the LLM) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 264.89 Td (The LLM is justified for these technical reasons:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 241.39 Td (1. Natural language understanding: It converts human language into structured intent.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 224.89 Td (2. NL2SQL generation: It can translate healthcare-record questions into SQL queries.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 208.39 Td (3. Personalized response generation: It explains retrieved user-specific records in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 191.89 Td (   simple language.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 175.39 Td (4. Follow-up generation: It suggests useful next questions based on the previous answer.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 158.89 Td (5. Caregiver-aware wording: It can adapt answers for elder or caregiver role.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 142.39 Td (6. Reduced UI complexity: Users do not need multiple filters and forms for every) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 125.89 Td (   possible query.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 109.39 Td (7. Better accessibility: Voice and text questions are easier than navigating many) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 92.89 Td (   screens.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 69.39 Td (The important design decision is that the LLM is not trusted directly. It does not access) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 50.00 28 Td (Page 1 of 14) Tj ET
endstream
