BT /F2 13.5 Tf 50.00 655.89 Td (Step 14: SQL Safety Validation) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 626.89 Td (The backend never executes LLM SQL directly.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 603.39 Td (sqlValidator.js enforces these rules:) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 574.89 Td (Exactly one statement) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 563.39 Td (Only SELECT queries) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 551.89 Td (Only allowed tables from schemaDescription.js) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 540.39 Td (No INSERT, UPDATE, DELETE, DROP, ALTER, CREATE, or other write commands) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 528.89 Td (No SQL comments) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 517.39 Td (No pg_* catalog access) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 505.89 Td (No information_schema access) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 494.39 Td (Every user-scoped table must include user id = $1) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 482.89 Td (Only $1 parameter is allowed) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 471.39 Td (LIMIT 100 is added if missing) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 447.89 Td (If validation fails, the user receives a safe fallback answer:) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 419.39 Td (I cannot answer that safely.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 395.89 Td (The failure reason is stored for debugging and evaluation.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13.5 Tf 50.00 363.39 Td (Step 15: Database Retrieval) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 334.39 Td (After validation, the backend executes the SQL using PostgreSQL.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 310.89 Td (The query is always bound with:) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 282.39 Td ($1 = authenticated user id) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 258.89 Td (The backend also sets a statement timeout, defaulting to 5 seconds, and limits returned rows) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 242.39 Td (to 100.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 218.89 Td (This protects performance and prevents long-running generated queries.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13.5 Tf 50.00 186.39 Td (Step 16: Redaction Before Answer Generation) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 157.39 Td (Before retrieved rows are sent back to the LLM for explanation, sensitive values are) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 140.89 Td (redacted.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 117.39 Td (Sensitive keys include:) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 88.89 Td (password) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 77.39 Td (password_hash) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 65.89 Td (token) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 50.00 28 Td (Page 9 of 14) Tj ET
