BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 349.89 Td (objects.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13.5 Tf 50.00 317.39 Td (Security and Safety Design) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 288.39 Td (The system has several safety layers:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 264.89 Td (1. JWT authentication ensures only logged-in users can call assistant APIs.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 248.39 Td (2. The backend uses req.user.id, not a user id from the frontend body.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 231.89 Td (3. Chat requests are rate limited.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 215.39 Td (4. LLM-generated SQL is validated before execution.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 198.89 Td (5. Only SELECT queries are allowed in the RAG SQL path.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 182.39 Td (6. Every user-specific query must include the authenticated user id.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 165.89 Td (7. Sensitive fields are redacted before LLM answer generation.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 149.39 Td (8. Database statement timeout prevents long-running queries.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 132.89 Td (9. Fallback responses are returned when safety checks fail.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 116.39 Td (10. Medical advice includes a non-diagnostic safety note.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 99.89 Td (11. Agentic write actions require confirmation.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 50.00 28 Td (Page 12 of 14) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
