BT /F2 13.5 Tf 50.00 776.89 Td (Caregiver Mode) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 747.89 Td (If the logged-in role is caregiver, the frontend adapts prompt wording.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 724.39 Td (Example elder prompt:) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 695.89 Td (Did I miss any medicine this week?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 672.39 Td (Caregiver prompt:) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 643.89 Td (Did your mother miss any medicine this week?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 620.39 Td (The backend still scopes data using the authenticated elder user id. The user_role is mainly) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 603.89 Td (used for wording and response style.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13.5 Tf 50.00 571.39 Td (Failure Handling) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 542.39 Td (The system handles failures safely:) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 513.89 Td (Empty message -> rejected) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 502.39 Td (ML-service unreachable -> friendly "try again" response) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 490.89 Td (NL2SQL parse failure -> fallback response) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 479.39 Td (Unsafe SQL -> "I cannot answer that safely") Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 467.89 Td (SQL execution failure -> simpler-question fallback) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 456.39 Td (Answer-generation failure -> raw retrieval fallback) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 444.89 Td (Voice module unavailable -> user can still type) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 433.39 Td (Microphone permission denied -> typed input remains available) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 409.89 Td (This makes the assistant resilient even when AI or voice dependencies fail.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13.5 Tf 50.00 377.39 Td (Why This Architecture Is Better Than a Direct LLM Chatbot) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 348.39 Td (A direct LLM chatbot would be risky because it could hallucinate, expose data incorrectly,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 331.89 Td (or generate unsupported medical guidance.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 308.39 Td (This architecture is safer because:) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 279.89 Td (The frontend never calls the LLM directly) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 268.39 Td (The backend controls identity and data access) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 256.89 Td (The LLM sees only an approved schema digest) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 245.39 Td (The SQL validator blocks unsafe queries) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 233.89 Td (The database query is user-scoped) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 222.39 Td (The final answer is based on retrieved rows) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 210.89 Td (Sensitive fields are redacted) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.3 Tf 60.00 199.39 Td (Actions require confirmation) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 175.89 Td (So the LLM improves usability, while the backend preserves safety and control.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13.5 Tf 50.00 143.39 Td (Final Technical Summary) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 114.39 Td (The assistant chat screen is an AI-assisted healthcare interface built with React Native,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 97.89 Td (Node/Express, PostgreSQL, FastAPI, and an LLM. The frontend manages the conversation UI,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 81.39 Td (voice input, voice output, loading state, follow-up chips, and chat history. The backend) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 64.89 Td (authenticates the user, classifies the message, handles deterministic health workflows,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 50.00 28 Td (Page 13 of 14) Tj ET
endstream
